// Recorded-shape CLOB market-channel replay. Built to the documented
// message schema (the venue hosts are unreachable from CI), and shaped to
// exercise the paths that actually break:
//   - a full book snapshot establishes sync,
//   - deltas move the top of book,
//   - a size-0 change DELETES the best level (the case where losing depth
//     would silently produce a wrong price),
//   - a disconnect marker forces the resync path,
//   - post-reconnect deltas arrive for a book that must NOT trust them
//     until REST re-establishes truth.
